    "faq_specs_h1": {
      "type": "faq-h1",
      "blocks": {
        "item_HDUehm": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Overview",
            "content": "<p>Your work setup comes with you. Herman Pro keeps your laptop, tablet and accessories organized for the commute, office and wherever you need to open your laptop next.</p><p>Reach your laptop without fully opening the roll top. Separate device storage, soft lining and an EVA bottom bumper help protect your equipment, while dedicated mouse and cable pockets keep smaller items easy to find.</p><p>Padded, adjustable shoulder straps and a four-zone airflow back panel support a more comfortable daily carry. Weather-resistant NA-TEX™ fabric helps protect against rain and everyday wear, and the half-roll top adds up to 5L when you need extra room.</p>",
            "use_variant_metafields": false,
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_item_size": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Size and Features",
            "content": "<p><strong>Capacity</strong>20L min, 25L max<br/><strong>Dimensions</strong>See diagram<br/><strong>Weight</strong>1.19kg (2.62lb)</p>",
            "use_variant_metafields": true,
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_item_fitment": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Laptop and Tablet Fit",
            "content": "<p>Keep your work devices together in Herman Pro’s dedicated tech compartment. Herman Pro features separate compartments for your laptop and tablet, with soft lining and an EVA bottom bumper for added protection in transit.</p>",
            "use_variant_metafields": false,
